WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.602 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Pope Francis last week
released a new book

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:03.737 line:92%
in which he says that gay people

00:00:03.737 --> 00:00:05.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
shouldn't be allowed
to be priests.

00:00:05.105 --> 00:00:07.774
One of our writers, Jenny Hagel,
is both gay and Catholic.

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
So she's here to comment
in a segment called

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.278 line:92%
"I Have Some Thoughts On This."

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:16.750 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.450 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey, Seth.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:18.752 size:78% position:39% line:92%
This is Pope Francis.

00:00:18.752 --> 00:00:20.120 line:92%
When he first became Pope,

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:22.689 align:start size:94% position:6%
everyone was like,
"This guy's cool."

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
He hung out with
Leonardo DiCaprio.

00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:27.827 size:84% position:42%
He said all of our pets
are going to heaven.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:28.795 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And while other Popes

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
have driven around
in Mercedes-Benzes,

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.366 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pope Francis
drives a Ford Focus.

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:37.203
Which probably helps with
the whole celibacy thing.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.438 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
So the press dubbed him
"Cool Pope."

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:42.108 size:78% position:39% line:92%
But here's the thing.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:43.176 size:75% position:38% line:92%
This guy's not cool.

00:00:43.176 --> 00:00:44.377 size:81% position:41% line:92%
This guy's homophobic.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.111 size:84% position:42% line:92%
If you're not Catholic,

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:48.248
you're probably thinking,
"Why should I care about this?"

00:00:48.248 --> 00:00:51.051
And if you are Catholic,
you're probably thinking,

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
"What's the latest
I can leave my house

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:56.423 line:92%
and still get to Mass on time?"

00:00:56.423 --> 00:00:58.124 align:start size:94% position:6%
But we should all
care about this

00:00:58.124 --> 00:00:59.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
because the Pope
is a world leader

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:02.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
who's giving people
permission to be prejudiced.

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:03.163 line:92%
I'm gay and I'm Catholic.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.331 align:start size:94% position:6%
When I came out,
some people in my family

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:07.333 align:start size:94% position:6%
told me that
I was going to hell.

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.202 line:92%
They got that idea at church.

00:01:09.202 --> 00:01:12.906
The same church that thinks
it's a good idea for 300 people

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.741 line:92%
to drink out of the same cup.

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.977 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:22.816 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Gross. That's gross.

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:25.452 size:81% position:41%
One relative told me
that because I was gay

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:26.453 line:92%
I wasn't fit to be a parent.

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:28.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I might not be,
but it's not because I'm gay.

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:32.258
It's because every time my
4-year-old wants to watch TV,

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:35.195 align:start size:94% position:6%
I lie and tell him
that the TV is sleeping.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:35.762 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:38.698
My son is lucky he has two moms
because that means

00:01:38.698 --> 00:01:42.335 align:start size:94% position:6%
he has two people telling him,
"Come here. Come here."

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:44.504 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:45.805 size:75% position:38% line:92%
This guy isn't cool.

00:01:45.805 --> 00:01:46.639 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Do you know what's cool?

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:50.543 align:start size:94% position:6%
Telling LGBTQ people that they
are perfect and beautiful

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.612 line:92%
and whole just the way they are.

00:01:52.612 --> 00:01:53.980 line:92%
This dude may seem harmless

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:56.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
because he's shuffling around
in a white robe.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:02:00.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
But remember, white robes are
the official uniform

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.555 line:92%
of people with bad ideas.

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:03.189 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Exhibit A.

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:10.797 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.165 align:start size:94% position:6%
I went to
a Catholic high school,

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:15.068 align:start size:94% position:6%
and they sent me an e-mail
last week asking me for money.

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:17.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll give you money when you
send a second e-mail

00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:20.707
saying that everyone who went to
your school is created equal.

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:22.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
And when you send me
a letter jacket

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:25.845
even though I was the worst
player on your tennis team.

00:02:25.845 --> 00:02:27.580 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.916 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I was voted "most ears."

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:33.052 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:35.989
Hate speech is hate speech,
and we need to call it out,

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:39.392
no matter where we see it,
even if it's in a Ford Focus.

00:02:39.392 --> 00:02:39.926 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:43.363
This has been
"I Have Some Thoughts On This."

